   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 835,
   "width": 570,
   "height": 16.25,
   "text": "Ownership and provenance",
   "originalText": "Ownership and provenance",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e96",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 96,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 96,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [],
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 860,
   "width": 566,
   "height": 195.0,
   "text": "Every document keeps its source: an upload (default) or the\nconnector (source: connector, seen time in uploaded_at).\nPolicy facts: read by the model, owned by the user once confirmed;\n  corrected_fields records which ones the user changed.\nRole, claim type, dates and references: stated by the user\n  (buttons or forms), validated at the API.\nAuthority: recorded by the caregiver with proof; the patient is the\n  grantor; Claimwise records it, it cannot grant it.\nStage, issues, payment and dispute status: derived, never stored\n  as a user decision, so they cannot drift from the evidence.\nAudit log: who did what and when (every button action, claim type,\n  authority recorded or withdrawn).\nConnector case id and server key stay on the server.",
   "originalText": "Every document keeps its source: an upload (default) or the\nconnector (source: connector, seen time in uploaded_at).\nPolicy facts: read by the model, owned by the user once confirmed;\n  corrected_fields records which ones the user changed.\nRole, claim type, dates and references: stated by the user\n  (buttons or forms), validated at the API.\nAuthority: recorded by the caregiver with proof; the patient is the\n  grantor; Claimwise records it, it cannot grant it.\nStage, issues, payment and dispute status: derived, never stored\n  as a user decision, so they cannot drift from the evidence.\nAudit log: who did what and when (every button action, claim type,\n  authority recorded or withdrawn).\nConnector case id and server key stay on the server.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e97",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 97,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 97,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [],
   "locked": false,
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 630,
   "y": 830,
   "width": 590,
   "height": 255,
   "roundness": null
  },
  {
   "id": "e98",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 98,
   "version": 1,
