   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 640,
   "y": 835,
   "width": 570,
   "height": 16.25,
   "text": "Versions, corrections and approval invalidation",
   "originalText": "Versions, corrections and approval invalidation",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e99",
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "seed": 99,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 99,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [],
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 642,
   "y": 860,
   "width": 566,
   "height": 165.0,
   "text": "A 2nd file of the same type: version_of set, choice pending;\n  replace -> old one superseded; keep -> both stay in the pack.\nA balance claim archives the first round's insurer letters and\n  encloses them; history keeps the first decision.\nCorrection flow: user corrects a policy fact -> policies updated ->\n  O2 recheck -> C1 recompute -> pack hash changes -> approval\n  stale (approval_invalidated) -> user approves again.\nLetters: an approved grievance or Ombudsman letter is bound to\n  its hash; a revised decision starts a new dispute view.\nWithdrawn authority clears the pack approval and blocks writes.\nQuery 'already sent' counts only documents held before the query.",
   "originalText": "A 2nd file of the same type: version_of set, choice pending;\n  replace -> old one superseded; keep -> both stay in the pack.\nA balance claim archives the first round's insurer letters and\n  encloses them; history keeps the first decision.\nCorrection flow: user corrects a policy fact -> policies updated ->\n  O2 recheck -> C1 recompute -> pack hash changes -> approval\n  stale (approval_invalidated) -> user approves again.\nLetters: an approved grievance or Ombudsman letter is bound to\n  its hash; a revised decision starts a new dispute view.\nWithdrawn authority clears the pack approval and blocks writes.\nQuery 'already sent' counts only documents held before the query.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "e100",
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "roughness": 0,
